{
  "id": "p20",
  "title": "The Pavilion Cafe",
  "titleZh": "球场边的咖啡馆",
  "topic": "公园咖啡馆的一天",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "My boss runs a small restaurant near the gate of the park.",
        "zh": "我老板在公园大门附近开了一家小餐馆。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We open at seven, when the first players arrive.",
        "zh": "我们七点开门，那时第一批球手就到了。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Our service is quick, and the chairs are soft and very comfortable.",
        "zh": "我们的服务很快，椅子柔软又非常舒服。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A famous scientist eats here and studies the forest.",
        "zh": "一位著名的科学家在这里吃饭，研究这片森林。"
      },
      {
        "en": "He carries a map of every tree and a small plastic case.",
        "zh": "他带着每棵树的地图，还有一个小塑料箱。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then he orders tea and looks at the pale morning sky.",
        "zh": "然后他点了茶，望着苍白的晨空。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "The card includes a short report on the local wildlife and birds.",
        "zh": "卡片上附着一份关于本地野生动物和鸟类的简短报告。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Such news repeats, and our trade grows all summer.",
        "zh": "这样的消息反复传来，我们的生意整个夏天都在增长。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Our guests depend on summer, and the tennis courts are full.",
        "zh": "我们的客人靠夏天吃饭，那时网球场总是满的。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The scientist has a simple plan, and his decision is a good one.",
        "zh": "科学家有个简单的计划，他的决定很明智。"
      },
      {
        "en": "He wants to weigh the honey and note its size.",
        "zh": "他想称一称蜂蜜，记下它的分量。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A queen bee is a symbol of a living place.",
        "zh": "一只蜂后，就是这片生机勃勃之地的象征。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "Early one morning a cook in a brown apron cuts her hand.",
        "zh": "一个清早，一位穿棕围裙的厨师切到了手。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The wound is small, but the sight of blood makes her pale.",
        "zh": "伤口很小，但看到血让她脸色发白。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The medical student has a drug and a clean knife.",
        "zh": "那位医学生有药，也有一把干净的小刀。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We tell the police about the old building.",
        "zh": "我们把那栋老建筑的事告诉警察。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Later the examination is short, and they leave without any fuss.",
        "zh": "后来检查很短，他们没多折腾就走了。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Our information is old, and the date on it is wrong.",
        "zh": "我们的资料很旧，上面的日期也错了。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "My thoughts were slow, but the energy was high.",
        "zh": "我脑子转得慢，可现场精力十足。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A young tennis player falls and hurts her right shoulder.",
        "zh": "一位年轻的网球手摔倒，伤了右肩。"
      },
      {
        "en": "She shows real courage, and the whole crowd cheers for her.",
        "zh": "她表现出真正的勇气，全场都为她欢呼。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The judge's judgment is fair, and her backing is strong and loud.",
        "zh": "裁判的判断公正，给她的支持也响亮有力。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then the crowd asks for one more game and cheers again.",
        "zh": "然后人群要求再打一局，又一次欢呼起来。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "Rain soaks our clothes and the old chairs, but we stay and laugh.",
        "zh": "雨水浸透我们的衣服和旧椅子，但我们留下大笑。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Anyone can see the ancient woods from the bottom of the hill.",
        "zh": "任何人都能从山脚望见那片古老的树林。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My favourite tree may die, and it is the saddest thing ever.",
        "zh": "我最喜欢的那棵树可能要死了，这是最令人难过的事。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We refuse to close, and people sing along in the cold rain.",
        "zh": "我们拒绝关门，人们在冷雨里跟着唱。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Nor does the rain stop us or our small activity.",
        "zh": "雨也没有拦住我们，或我们这点小小的活动。"
      }
    ]
  ],
